      "lines": [
        "[F/C]Hover o'er [Gm/Bb]me, Holy [F]Spirit, [Dm/F]Bathe my [Gm/Bb]trembling [F/C]heart [C7]and brow;",
        "[Bb]Fill me [C]with Thy [F/C]hallowed [C]presence, [F/C]Come, O [Gm/Bb]come and [Dm/A]fill me [F]now.",
        "[Dm/F]Fill me now, [Gm/Bb]fill [F/C]me now, [C7]Jesus, [F/C]come and [Gm/Bb]fill [Dm/A]me now.",
        "[C]Fill me with Thy hallowed [F/C]presence, Come, [Am]O [Bb]come and fill me [C]now."
      ]
    },
    {
