        "[Bb]At [C]Thy sacred [F/C]feet [Gm/Bb]I [Dm/A]bow;",
        "[Dm/F]Blest, divine, [F/C]eternal [Gm/Bb]Spirit,",
        "[C]Fill with love, [F/C]and [Am]fill [Bb]me now."
